  "releaseNotes": "Actively maintained fork of the EntitySpaces ORM, modernized for .NET Framework 4.8 through .NET 10 and aligned with EntitySpaces Studio 2026.11.\n\nOracle: ODP.NET Managed Client, Oracle Cloud Autonomous Database wallet support, GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY, NUMBER(p,s) mapped to decimal, concurrency translation (ORA-00001, ORA-00060, ORA-08177), Oracle 12c-19c.\n\nFull release notes: https://github.com/paulcordova/EntitySpaces/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
